			"id":"16d28d3dffadb96e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"\n# A. 10 Clarification Questions\n\n|#|Question|Mục đích|\n|---|---|---|\n|1|**Just to confirm, does WFX currently have any supported API for Common GDI for FPO creation?**|Xác nhận API create GDI đã tồn tại hay chưa|\n|2|**Can we confirm whether one API request should create one GDI only?**|Chốt transaction model đơn giản|\n|3|**Does WFX require one GDI per FPO, or can multiple FPOs be included in the same GDI?**|Chốt business rule quan trọng nhất|\n|4|**If multiple FPOs can be combined, what conditions must be the same—for example Site, Store, OC, Style, or Category?**|Hiểu rule grouping|\n|5|**Can WFX expose the same Material Allocation and Adhoc Indent information currently shown on the UI through API?**|Xác nhận fetch capability|\n|6|**Can the API return current Open Quantity and available stock before GDI creation?**|Chốt quantity source|\n|7|**Can both full-open issue and partial issue be supported through the API?**|Chốt quantity behavior|\n|8|**Will WFX perform the final validation again when the GDI creation request is submitted?**|Không để PPJ tự replicate validation|\n|9|**Can the generated GDI No. be returned directly in the API response after successful creation?**|Chốt output quan trọng nhất|\n|10|**Can we treat Batch ID and Request Row ID as PPJ-internal references, while only using Client Request ID for transaction tracing and duplicate prevention?**|Đơn giản hóa JSON|\n\n# B. 10 Discovery Questions\n\n|#|Question|Mục đích|\n|---|---|---|\n|1|**Could you walk us through what happens internally in WFX when a user clicks “Issue” on Common GDI for FPO?**|Hiểu transaction logic thật|\n|2|**What are the minimum mandatory header-level fields required to create a valid GDI?**|Chốt payload tối thiểu|\n|3|**What are the minimum mandatory line-level fields required for each material line?**|Chốt line mapping|\n|4|**Which WFX unique identifiers should PPJ use for Material Allocation, Indent, Article, FPO, Site, and Store?**|Tránh dùng display name làm key|\n|5|**What validations can cause a GDI creation request to fail?**|Xây error handling|\n|6|**What business conditions force WFX to split materials into separate GDIs?**|Hiểu split logic|\n|7|**Which fields or quantities may change between data retrieval and final GDI creation?**|Hiểu concurrency / stale data risk|\n|8|**If the API request times out, how can PPJ check whether the GDI was actually created before retrying?**|Chống duplicate|\n|9|**What API or interface can PPJ use to retrieve GDI status and transaction details after creation?**|Chốt tracking|\n|10|**Based on the existing WFX architecture, what is the simplest API design you would recommend for PPJ to implement Phase 1?**|Để WFX đề xuất solution tối giản|\n\n## 5 câu nên ưu tiên nhất nếu meeting thiếu thời gian\n\n1. **Does WFX already have an API for Common GDI for FPO creation?**\n    \n2. **Does WFX require one GDI per FPO, or can multiple FPOs be combined?**\n    \n3. **What are the minimum mandatory header and line fields?**\n    \n4. **Can WFX perform all existing validations during API submission?**\n    \n5. **What is the simplest API design WFX recommends for Phase 1?**\n    \n\n## Câu để kéo discussion về đúng hướng\n\nNếu WFX bắt đầu đi quá sâu vào JSON:\n\n> **Since PPJ has not built the automation application yet, we would prefer to first align on WFX business rules and available API capabilities, then finalize the JSON design accordingly.**\n\nNếu cần tránh over-engineering:\n\n> **For Phase 1, our preference is to keep the integration as simple as possible and follow the existing WFX transaction logic rather than introduce a new transaction model.**",
